From: VultaV <unc1010@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ucode: handle the STATUS_BREAK status

ucode 2026-10-18 adds STATUS_BREAK to uc_vm_status_t for debugger break
requests. uhttpd never requests a break, but -Werror=switch fails the
build. Treat it like a runtime error.

--- a/ucode.c
+++ b/ucode.c
@@ -304,6 +304,7 @@ uh_ucode_state_init(struct ucode_prefix
 		fprintf(stderr, "Error: Compilation error while executing ucode handler\n");
 		exit(1);
 
+	case STATUS_BREAK:
 	case ERROR_RUNTIME:
 		fprintf(stderr, "Error: Runtime error while executing ucode handler\n");
 		exit(2);
